<body>

<div class="proposal-header">
  <div class="company-tagline">PROJECT PROPOSAL &amp; SCOPE OF WORK</div>
  <h1>FreshMart: Digital Khata, Smart Voice POS &amp; Merchant Platform</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">Next-Generation Retail Operating System for Local Merchants &amp; Supermarkets</div>
  
  <table class="meta-grid">
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Document Type:</strong> First-Level Project &amp; Technical Proposal</td>
      <td><strong>Target Audience:</strong> Executive Management &amp; Stakeholders</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Document Version:</strong> 1.0 (Proposal Phase)</td>
      <td><strong>Deployment Model:</strong> Multi-Tenant SaaS (Web, Android, iOS)</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<h2>1. Executive Summary &amp; Project Vision</h2>
<p>
  <strong>FreshMart</strong> is a next-generation retail operating and customer credit (Udhaar) management platform engineered specifically for local neighborhood merchants, grocery shops, provision stores, bakeries, and local supermarkets.
</p>
<p>
  Unlike traditional complex ERPs or basic ledger apps that suffer from high typing friction, cumbersome inventory maintenance, and expensive external hardware dependencies, FreshMart delivers a <strong>zero-hardware, voice-first, direct-settlement ecosystem</strong>. It empowers shopkeepers to record transactions in seconds, balance daily cash registers effortlessly, eliminate soundbox rental costs, and collect dues directly into their own bank accounts via dynamic UPI.
</p>

<h2>2. Problem Statement &amp; Market Opportunity</h2>
<table class="data-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 40%;">Existing Market Friction</th>
      <th style="width: 60%;">FreshMart Solution &amp; Innovation</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Manual Typing Overhead:</strong> Busy shopkeepers during rush hours cannot type item-by-item on a mobile keyboard.</td>
      <td><strong>Voice-Activated Quick Sales &amp; OCR:</strong> Spoken input (e.g., <em>"56 note on sale"</em>, <em>"Ramesh 2kg sugar 80"</em>) and paper slip image extraction.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Hardware Rental Fees:</strong> Payment companies charge merchants ₹100–₹150 every month for physical voice soundbox speakers.</td>
      <td><strong>In-App Voice Soundbox:</strong> Built-in mobile speech engine announcing payments aloud for free via the merchant's smartphone.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Gateway Fees &amp; Payout Delays:</strong> Traditional payment gateways deduct 2% transaction fees and hold funds in escrow.</td>
      <td><strong>0% Direct Bank Settlement:</strong> Generates direct merchant UPI payment links and dynamic QR codes with immediate direct-to-bank credit.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Daily Cash Drawer Discrepancies:</strong> Difficulty reconciling morning opening change with cash sales, expenses, and credit collections.</td>
      <td><strong>Daily Galla Reconciliation:</strong> Automated real-time cash balancing tool with 30-second day-end physical count verification.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Morning Recurring Regulars:</strong> 50+ customers take daily milk, bread, or water cans, currently tracked with scratch marks on paper.</td>
      <td><strong>Morning Regulars "Parcha" Checklist:</strong> 1-tap attendance-style batch recording for daily fixed deliveries.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>3. Scope of Work (SOW)</h2>

<h3>3.1. In-Scope Modules</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Multi-Tenant Architecture:</strong> Complete data isolation where multiple independent shopkeepers operate with their own customer ledgers, branding, and bank UPI accounts.</li>
  <li><strong>Voice-to-Sale &amp; Voice-to-Ledger Engine:</strong> Multi-lingual speech-to-intent parsing for instantaneous cash sales and customer purchase entries.</li>
  <li><strong>Daily Galla (Cash Register) Management:</strong> Opening cash tracking, quick sales, drawer cash expenses, and day-end closing reconciliation.</li>
  <li><strong>Mobile Voice Soundbox:</strong> Native text-to-speech engine with high-fidelity digital chime for real-time payment announcements.</li>
  <li><strong>Credit Risk Scoring &amp; Bad-Debt Prevention:</strong> Traffic-light scoring (<span class="badge badge-green">🟢 Good Standing</span>, <span class="badge badge-amber">🟡 Attention Due</span>, <span class="badge badge-red">🔴 High Risk</span>) based on payment velocity and credit limit utilization.</li>
  <li><strong>AI Paper Chit &amp; Receipt Scanner:</strong> Intelligent line-item extraction from handwritten bills and distributor invoices.</li>
  <li><strong>Morning Regulars / Subscription Tally:</strong> Batch logging for daily milk, water cans, and bread routines.</li>
  <li><strong>Omni-Channel Customer Communication:</strong> Dynamic WhatsApp payment reminders and automated Email fallback for customer onboarding and digital receipts.</li>
  <li><strong>Printable Counter QR Standee:</strong> High-resolution printable counter poster generator with shop branding and UPI QR code.</li>
</ul>

<h3>3.2. Out-of-Scope (Deliberate Design Boundaries)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Complex warehouse batching / barcode logistics (Unnecessary overhead for local retail counters).</li>
  <li>Third-party delivery fleet integrations (Local neighborhood shops cater to counter and walk-in trade).</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Functional Module Specifications</h2>

<h3>Module 1: Multi-Tenant Direct UPI Settlement</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Shop Profile VPA Binding:</strong> During onboarding, each shopkeeper sets their unique UPI ID (e.g., <code>sharma@okhdfcbank</code>, <code>9876543210@paytm</code>).</li>
  <li><strong>Dynamic Customer Linkage:</strong> Customers belonging to Shop A pay Shop A; customers of Shop B pay Shop B.</li>
  <li><strong>Zero Commission:</strong> Direct peer-to-merchant NPCI UPI rails with 0% intermediary deductions.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Module 2: Daily Galla (Cash Register Balancing)</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Real-time Cash Formula:</strong> <code>Opening Cash + Quick Cash Sales + Udhaar Cash Collected - Drawer Expenses = Expected Cash</code>.</li>
  <li><strong>Day-End Closing:</strong> The shopkeeper enters physical cash counted in the drawer at closing. The engine calculates variance (<code>Balanced Perfectly ✅</code>, <code>Short ⚠️</code>, or <code>Excess 💰</code>) and archives daily records.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Module 3: Voice-Activated POS Assistant</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Natural Language Parser:</strong> Spoken voice commands instantly log transactions without keyboard typing.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Module 4: Customer Credit Risk &amp; Bad-Debt Shield</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Prevents over-leveraging customers and triggers visual alerts on overdue balances before extending new credit.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Module 5: Morning Regulars ("Parcha" Subscription Tally)</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Enables merchants to configure regular daily customers and batch log 20+ customer deliveries in 5 seconds.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. User Roles &amp; Access Control Matrix (RBAC)</h2>
<table class="data-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>User Role</th>
      <th>Functional Access &amp; Privileges</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>System Admin</strong></td>
      <td>Platform monitoring, shop owner onboarding, tenant activation/deactivation, gross platform telemetry.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Shop Owner (Merchant)</strong></td>
      <td>Full store administration, customer ledger control, voice sales, cash register, regulars, reports, and QR standee.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Customer</strong></td>
      <td>Read-only access to self-service digital passbook, itemized receipt breakdown, and 1-tap UPI payment settlement.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>6. Technology Stack &amp; Architecture</h2>
<div class="callout-box-blue">
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Frontend Client:</strong> React Native / Expo (SDK 57) with NativeWind (TailwindCSS), responsive across Web, Android, and iOS.</li>
    <li><strong>Backend API Server:</strong> Node.js, Express 5.x RESTful API architecture.</li>
    <li><strong>Database:</strong> MongoDB with Mongoose ODM (Multi-tenant indexing &amp; schema validations).</li>
    <li><strong>Speech &amp; Audio:</strong> Web SpeechRecognition, Web Audio API synthesizers &amp; native Text-to-Speech engines.</li>
    <li><strong>Communications:</strong> Nodemailer SMTP mail engine &amp; dynamic WhatsApp deep-links.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2>7. Business Benefits &amp; Expected Return on Investment (ROI)</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Immediate Cost Savings:</strong> Saves ₹1,200–₹1,800/year per store on hardware voice soundbox rentals.</li>
  <li><strong>Zero Gateway Fees:</strong> Saves 2% on all digital collections by leveraging direct UPI rails.</li>
  <li><strong>Faster Debt Recovery:</strong> Deep-linked UPI payment reminders sent via WhatsApp and Email accelerate overdue collections by 35–50%.</li>
  <li><strong>High Merchant Retention:</strong> 30-second daily cash balancing and 1-tap morning milk tallies make the app an indispensable daily operating tool.</li>
</ol>

